      </div>

      <div class="experience-grid">

        <!-- Role 1: Social Media -->
        <div class="exp-card">
          <div>
            <div class="exp-date">2023 – PRESENT (3+ YRS)</div>
            <h3>Senior Social Media Manager &amp; Growth Strategist</h3>
            <div class="exp-company">Remote Retainers &amp; Global Brand Accounts</div>
            <p>Spearheading organic social media growth, viral short-form video hooks, community building, and automated DM lead funnels. Consistently scaling follower bases from cold traffic to 85K+ engaged communities.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Role 2: Digital Marketing -->
        <div class="exp-card">
          <div>
            <div class="exp-date">2022 – PRESENT</div>
            <h3>Digital Marketing &amp; Paid Ads Strategist</h3>
            <div class="exp-company">Meta &amp; Google Performance Campaigns</div>
            <p>Architecting full-funnel acquisition roadmaps for e-commerce and B2B clients. Managing creative testing frameworks, dynamic retargeting, and GA4 attribution to deliver 4.2x–6.8x verified ROAS while cutting CPA.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Role 3: Graphic Design & Branding -->
        <div class="exp-card">
          <div>
            <div class="exp-date">2021 – PRESENT</div>
            <h3>Freelance Brand Identity &amp; Graphic Designer</h3>
            <div class="exp-company">50+ International Client Deliveries</div>
            <p>Designing high-CTR social ad creatives, complete brand guidelines, investor pitch decks, and custom vector templates. Trusted by founders and agencies across the US, UK, and UAE with 5-star ratings.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Role 4: Data Entry & Systems -->
        <div class="exp-card">
          <div>
            <div class="exp-date">7+ YEARS RIGOR</div>
            <h3>Systems Architecture &amp; Data Precision Lead</h3>
            <div class="exp-company">Enterprise Databases &amp; Inventory Systems</div>
            <p>Architecting automated MS Excel and Google Sheets systems with advanced VLOOKUP, XLOOKUP, and Index-Match formulas. 100% data entry precision across 25,000+ complex operational records with automated executive reporting.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

      </div>

